        "minimum_cgpa": null,
        "nationality_requirement": null,
        "eligibility_summary": "NPTEL course toppers and candidates passing the certification exam in the Elite-Gold category are only eligible to apply. The internships will be considered for the Students and Faculty members (as per the profession selected during the course enrolment). The students will be considered for the in-person internships only. Faculty members who cannot avail leave from their workplace and the candidates with disabilities (PwD) will only be considered for the virtual internship, wherever feasible.",
        "application_method": null,
        "application_url": null,
        "contact_email": null,
        "extraction_notes": [
          "The NPTEL office will contact the course instructor to check if they can take interns from the toppers/Elite-Gold category of learners of their respective courses. The NPTEL will send the communication in this regard by April for the Summer internships and by October for the Winter internships."
        ],
        "evidence": [
          {
            "field_name": "eligibility_summary",
            "source_location": "Page 1, line 34-52",
            "quote": "NPTEL course toppers and candidates passing the certification exam in the Elite-Gold category are only eligible to apply. The internships will be considered for the Students and Faculty members (as per the profession selected during the course enrolment). The students will be considered for the in-person internships only. Faculty members who cannot avail leave from their workplace and the candidates with disabilities (PwD) will only be considered for the virtual internship, wherever feasible."
          },
          {
            "field_name": "stipend",
            "source_location": "Page 2, line 34-42",
            "quote": "The stipend for the in-person NPTEL internship has been revised effective from Summer Internship 2025 as per the following details. No stipends are payable for the virtual internship. Duration Stipend amount 2 weeks Rs. 7500/- 4 weeks Rs. 15,000/- 6 weeks Rs. 22,500/- 8 weeks Rs. 30,000/- 10 weeks Rs. 37,500/- 12 weeks Rs. 45,000/- The stipend will be payable on successful completion of the internship."
          }
        ]
      },
